OL,3,AMan dies after being hit by ambulance
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has died after being struck by an
OL,6,Fambulance transporting a patient near
OL,7,FSunderland, Northumbria Police said.
OL,9,FThe force said it happened on the A19
OL,10,Fshortly after 02:00 GMT.
OL,12,FThe ambulance was travelling on the
OL,13,Fnorthbound carriageway and did not have
OL,14,Fits blue lights on when it hit the man,
OL,15,Fwho was in his 30s and died at the
OL,16,Fscene.
OL,18,FNo-one in the ambulance was injured and
OL,19,Fthe driver, a man in his 40s, remained
OL,20,Fat the scene to assist police with
OL,21,Ftheir inquiries, the force said.
